想不开时打一个电话。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["把 218 项随机分组的对照试验、14170 人合起来算（网络荟萃分析）。对照组是同样在做别的活动的人。和他们相比，步行或慢跑对抑郁的效果大小 g = -0.62（95% 可信区间 -0.80 到 -0.45）。瑜伽 -0.55，力量训练 -0.49。强度越大效果越好。把多项光照治疗研究合起来算：季节性抑郁效果大小 0.84（0.60 到 1.08），非季节性抑郁 0.53（0.18 到 0.89）。还有一项分析，把各项研究逐个病人的数据合起来算。它看的是互联网认知行为疗法（网上自助课程）。有人指导和无人指导，都比对照组好。中重度（PHQ-9 大于 9 分）的时候，有人指导的更好。12356 是全国心理援助热线，每日开通不少于 18 小时。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Noetel M 等 (2024). Effect of exercise for depression: systematic review and network meta-analysis of randomised controlled trials. BMJ. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj-2023-075847","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj-2023-075847"]},"；Golden RN 等 (2005). The efficacy of light therapy in the treatment of mood disorders: a review and meta-analysis of the evidence. American Journal of Psychiatry. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1176/appi.ajp.162.4.656","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1176/appi.ajp.162.4.656"]},"；Karyotaki E 等 (2021). Internet-Based Cognitive Behavioral Therapy for Depression: A Systematic Review and Individual Patient Data Network Meta-analysis. JAMA Psychiatry. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1001/jamapsychiatry.2020.4364","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1001/jamapsychiatry.2020.4364"]},"；国家卫生健康委 (2024). 关于应用\"12356\"全国统一心理援助热线电话号码的通知（国卫医政函〔2024〕259 号）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202412/content_6994470.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202412/content_6994470.htm"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["这些都是轻中度抑郁的辅助手段。中重度、有自杀念头的要去就医，先打 12356（见第 1 节第 25 条）。运动试验大多人数少，又没法像试药那样瞒住谁在运动。光照研究只到 2003 年，人数也少。那些研究用的是专门的光照灯，不是晒太阳。把它换成白天出门晒太阳，是从光照治疗推出来的。「按时睡」「找人说」是作者经验，没有单列文献。别把「动起来」当成对抑郁者的要求，能走十分钟就算数。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/03-17"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"生气时先离场，把对方当天气而不是当敌人"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/03-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"把警察、医生、柜员当成按规则上班的人，别当成角色：能推动事情的是文书和期限，不是情绪"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-14"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["发现自己在反复回想同一件糟心事时，换个需要动手的活"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["反复回想同一件糟心事，会加重抑郁，把负面念头钉得更牢，让人更解决不了问题，也更难真动手。它还会把身边愿意听你说的人耗光。察觉到自己在原地绕，就去干点要动手的活。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-15"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["把「事情肯定会更糟」这类念头当症状看，不当事实看"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["一项跟踪了 20 年的双生子研究里，悲观程度每高一个档，同期死亡的概率高约 13%，死于心血管病的概率高约 20%。反过来，乐观得分高并没有带来相应的好处。所以…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-16"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["减少让你消耗的人际关系，学会拒绝不想接的请求"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["一项对 60 到 89 岁丧偶女性的调查里，让人难受的来往和幸福感的关系，比让人舒服的来往更强，也更一致。所以先做减法，再做加法。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-20"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["别把「别人过得怎么样」当每日必读：给刷同龄人动态的应用设限或关掉"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["习惯在网上跟过得更好的人比的人，往往情绪更差、自尊更低。把 Facebook 停用四周的人，幸福感小幅提高，但对时事的了解也掉了一截。把三个社交平台各限到每天…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-21"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["觉得「所有人都看见我出丑了」的时候，把这个估计除以二"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["穿尴尬的 T 恤进屋，以为将近一半人认得出衣服上印的是谁，实际不到四分之一。换成体面的 T 恤也一样高估。小组讨论完，人也以为自己说错的话在别人眼里更显眼，聊天…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-22"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["把「别人要求我做到完美」当症状看，不当事实看"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["总觉得「周围的人要求我完美，做不到就会被否定」的人，更容易有自杀念头。「我自己要求自己完美」和自杀念头的关系弱得多，只有前一种的三分之一左右。把原本就有的念头扣…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/03"},"children":["阅读整个主题：不要浪费精力 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strok